OL,3,GNEWSAWill a new strategy help protect
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland's nature?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new strategy to restore and enhance
OL,7,Fprotection for nature in Northern
OL,8,FIreland has been launched by the
OL,9,Fagriculture and environment minister.
OL,11,FAbout 40% of the plants and animals in
OL,12,Fprotected sites across Northern Ireland
OL,13,Ffall short of meeting the standard for
OL,14,F"favourable condition".
OL,16,FAnd just one of 49 priority habitat
OL,17,Ftypes - like ancient and native
OL,18,Fwoodlands, blanket bogs and
OL,19,Fspecies-rich grasslands - have
OL,20,Ffavourable status.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
